&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Develop and implement supplier quality management programs, including audits, assessments,&amp;nbsp;material readiness reviews,&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;qualification activities/criteria.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:120,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:120,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
